ha-eb300-ble — third-party attributions
=======================================

Protocol
--------
This integration implements the Ebeco EB300 Open Local API, Rev 1.0
(2026-03-27).

    Source: Ebeco AB
    https://www.ebeco.com/en/solutions/underfloor-heating/ebeco-open-api

Ebeco's terms for material provided via their Open APIs require that Ebeco is
stated as the source. This project does not redistribute their document; refer
to the URL above for the wire format. Ebeco also notes that available features
and commands vary by product model and firmware version, and that some
functions are reserved for Ebeco's own applications and backend.

